  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Rule of Law and Promoting Women- and Youth-led Community Security for Inclusive Justice and Democratic Governance in The Gambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen peace, security, and democratic resilience in The Gambia ahead of the 2026&#x2013;2027 electoral cycle by addressing community insecurity, youth vulnerability, gender-based violence, and electoral risks. It focuses on the Greater Banjul Area and West Coast Region, adopting a prevention-oriented approach that links community-level security and peacebuilding with institutional strengthening and electoral preparedness. Women and youth are prioritized as key agents of violenc</narrative>
  </description>
